> up
Living Room
This is the living room. There is a door to the east. To the west is a wooden door with strange gothic lettering, which appears to be nailed shut. A trophy case takes up one corner of the room. A large oriental rug lies to one side of the room, moved away from the trap door it once covered.

You can see an incense, a skeleton key, a guidebook, a matchbook, a large brochure, a wrench, a screwdriver, a trunk, a brass bell, a black book, a burned-out candles, and a sharp stick here.

In the trophy case you see a portrait, a painting, a stack of zorkmid bills, a platinum bar, a Don Woods stamp, a gold coffin, a large emerald, a beautiful statue, a pot of gold, a jewel-encrusted egg, a pearl necklace, a tin of spices, and a white white crystal sphere.

> inventory
You are carrying:

a glass bottle, blue cake, eat-me cake, brass lantern, sapphire bracelet, ivory torch, huge diamond

